  "changed_since_previous": "Minor adjustments or rebase; the commit structure and overall approach are unchanged.",
  "card": "This PR replaces the wallet's mapWallet and wtxOrdered containers with a single boost::multi_index_container indexed by txid and insertion order. Previously, looking up transactions both by hash and by sequence required two containers, where wtxOrdered kept raw pointers into mapWallet and required manual synchronization. The refactor removes redundant container management and pointer storage across wallet components. It is an internal cleanup with no dependencies or user-facing changes.",
